<title>USA: Penederm to sell 752,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>Penederm to sell 752,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>FOSTER CITY, Calif. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Penederm Inc Tuesday said it signed an accord to sell 752,000 shares of its common stock to institutional investors in a private placement.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said the net proceeds are estimated to be approximately $9 million.  The closing of the transaction is conditioned upon the effectiveness of a registration statement to be filed by the Company covering resales by the investors.</p>
<p>Penederm is a pharmaceutical company that specializes in development and marketing of dermatology products.</p>
